Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Forms|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And these variables
		|portalURL|TestPropsUtil#get('portal.url')|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Forms|
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Add Form
	And Form edit Name
	And Form edit Page Title
		|formPageName|Page 1|
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Single Selection|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Choose Your Destiny|
	And FormFields edit Options Row
		|optionName|Destiny1|
		|optionValue|Destiny 1|
	And FormFields edit Options Row
		|optionName|Destiny2|
		|optionValue|Destiny 2|
		|rowNumber|2|
	And FormFields edit Options Row
		|optionName|Destiny3|
		|optionValue|Destiny 3|
		|rowNumber|3|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form add Page
	And Form edit Page Title
		|formPageName|Page 2|
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Destiny 1|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form add Page
	And Form edit Page Title
		|formPageName|Page 3|
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Destiny 2|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form add Page
	And Form edit Page Title
		|formPageName|Page 4|
	And Form goto Add Field
		|fieldType|Text Field|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldValue|Destiny 3|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules add Rule
	And FormRules configure Condition Options
		|conditionField|Choose Your Destiny|
		|conditionOperator|Is equal to|
		|conditionRowNumber|1|
		|conditionValueField|Destiny 2|
		|conditionValueType|Value|
	And FormRules configure Action Options
		|action|Jump to Page|
		|actionRowNumber|1|
		|actionTarget|3 Page 3|
	And FormRules save
	And FormRules add Rule
	And FormRules configure Condition Options
		|conditionField|Choose Your Destiny|
		|conditionOperator|Is equal to|
		|conditionRowNumber|1|
		|conditionValueField|Destiny 3|
		|conditionValueType|Value|
	And FormRules configure Action Options
		|action|Jump to Page|
		|actionRowNumber|1|
		|actionTarget|4 Page 4|
	And FormRules save
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Form Builder
	Then Form save

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: View Form Rules Summary
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules view Summary
		|action|Jump to Page|
		|actionTarget|3 Page 3|
		|conditionField|Choose Your Destiny|
		|conditionFieldConstant|Destiny 2|
		|conditionOperator|equal to|
		|ruleNumber|1|
	Then FormRules view Summary
		|action|Jump to Page|
		|actionTarget|4 Page 4|
		|conditionField|Choose Your Destiny|
		|conditionFieldConstant|Destiny 3|
		|conditionOperator|equal to|
		|ruleNumber|2|
Scenario: View Pages After Jump
Priority: 5
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When these properties
		|portal.acceptance|pending|
	And Form publish Form
	And FormsAdminNavigator open Publish URL
		|publishFormURL|${publishedFormPublicURL}|
	And FormFields select Radio Option
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
		|radioOption|Destiny 1|
	And FormPortlet next Page
		|formPageCurrent|Page 1|
		|formPageNext|Page 2|
	And FormFields view Text Field
		|fieldLabel|Destiny 1|
		|fieldName|Destiny1|
	And FormPortlet previous Page
	And FormFields select Radio Option
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
		|radioOption|Destiny 2|
	And FormPortlet next Page
		|formPageCurrent|Page 1|
		|formPageNext|Page 3|
	And FormFields view Text Field
		|fieldLabel|Destiny 2|
		|fieldName|Destiny2|
	And FormPortlet previous Page
	And FormFields select Radio Option
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
		|radioOption|Destiny 3|
	And FormPortlet next Page
		|formPageCurrent|Page 1|
		|formPageNext|Page 4|
	And FormFields view Text Field
		|fieldLabel|Destiny 3|
		|fieldName|Destiny3|
	And FormPortlet previous Page
	And FormFields select Radio Option
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
		|radioOption|Destiny 2|
	And FormPortlet next Page
		|formPageCurrent|Page 1|
		|formPageNext|Page 3|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|Destiny2|
		|fieldValue|After skipping to page 3|
	And FormPortlet next Page
		|formPageCurrent|Page 3|
		|formPageNext|Page 4|
	And FormFields edit Text
		|fieldName|Destiny3|
		|fieldValue|Also fill out page 4|
	Then FormPortlet submit Successfully
Scenario: View Rule After Label Edit
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When FormsAdminNavigator goto Edit Field
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
	And Form edit Field Label
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
		|fieldValue|Edit Label|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules goto Edit
		|ruleNumber|1|
	And these variables
		|key_conditionRowNumber|1|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Edit Label' at locator 'FormRules#RULE_BUILDER_CONDITION_FIELD'
Scenario: View Rule After Option Value Edit
Priority: 3
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When FormsAdminNavigator goto Edit Field
		|fieldName|ChooseYourDestiny|
	And FormFields edit Options Row
		|optionName|Destiny2|
		|optionValue|Edited Destiny|
		|rowNumber|2|
	And Form close Sidebar
	And Form save
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules goto Edit
		|ruleNumber|1|
	And these variables
		|key_conditionRowNumber|1|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value 'Edited Destiny' at locator 'FormRules#RULE_BUILDER_CONDITION_VALUE_FIELD'
Scenario: View Rule After Page Name Change
Priority: 4
##########################################################
The Poshi description element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	When Form goto Form Page
		|formPageName|Page 3|
	And Form edit Page Title
		|formPageName|Renamed Page|
	And Form save
	And FormsAdminNavigator goto Rules
	And FormRules goto Edit
		|ruleNumber|1|
	And these variables
		|key_actionRowNumber|1|
	Then AssertTextEquals the value '3 Renamed Page' at locator 'FormRules#RULE_BUILDER_JUMP_TO_PAGE_ACTION_TARGET'